<title>PAKISTAN: CRICKET-PAKISTAN SET NEW ZEALAND 229 TO WIN.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-PAKISTAN SET NEW ZEALAND 229 TO WIN.</headline>
<dateline>GUJRANWALA, Pakistan 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pakistan made 228 for eight in the first one-day international against New Zealand on Wednesday. The innings was shortened to 46 overs because of sun glare early in the day.</p>
</text>
